IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sis-members`

-- Superannuation Industry (Supervision) Act 1993 (Cth) with the SIS Regulations 1994, the fund member's questions -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case. The SIS Regulations 1994 are deposited and are read here.
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_superannuation-industry-supervision-act-1993_baseline.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

-- Life facts are from the workbench scenarios au/wa/cradle-to-grave-{chloe,jake,daniel}/facts.json: Chloe born 14 March 2003;
-- Jake born 30 August 2006, a stroke on 14 March 2063; Giuseppe born 14 February 1968, dies 3 November 2052, wife Maria;
-- Daniel born 9 April 1996, dies 21 October 2078, wife Priya (born 23 August 1997). Balances, the day Jake left work
-- (1 June 2063), and the contents of the nominations are HYPOTHETICAL: the lives do not state them.

