#ASSERT NOT `Is this person my dependant` `a friend`

#ASSERT `Is this person my legal personal representative` `holder of an enduring power of attorney I granted`
#ASSERT NOT `Is this person my legal personal representative` `holder of an ordinary power of attorney`

